    "longDescription": "<p>Starting December 1, 2026, we&#8217;re migrating notifications on GitHub.com over the course of a week to make subscriptions more predictable, correct unexpected behavior, and support the growing scale of activity.&#8230;</p> <p>The post <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-24-more-predictable-notifications-on-github-com\">More predictable notifications on GitHub.com</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://github.blog\">The GitHub Blog</a>.</p>",
